Reverse Sacrifice

	Philosophy

		-
			Whereas sacrifice is the forfeiture of a given thing, reverse sacrifice is the
			forfeiture of value sufficient to acquire or restore said thing.

			As itself a form of sacrifice, the same mechanics and meaning applied to ordinary
			sacrifice may be applied to reverse sacrifice.
		-

	Principles

		Reverse Financial Sacrifice

			-
				Reverse financial sacrifice refers to money given to charity.
			-

		Reverse Animal Sacrifice

			-
				Reverse animal sacrifice refers to a charitable or otherwise altruistic act which
				does, or can be reasonably expected to save an animal life.
			-

		Reverse Human Sacrifice

			-
				Reverse human sacrifice refers to a charitable or otherwise altruistic act which
				does, or can be reasonably expected to save a human life.
			-